1
00:00:00,186 --> 00:00:01,936
(Wil:)Hey, Sheldon.

2
00:00:02,314 --> 00:00:05,604
I wanted you to know I'm looking forward
to wiping the floor with you.

3
00:00:05,817 --> 00:00:09,817
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes? Well, before I respond,
let me ask you a question.

4
00:00:10,822 --> 00:00:13,952
(Sheldon:)Is your mother a good or poor bowler?

5
00:00:20,373 --> 00:00:23,083
(Wil:)-After you.
-No, after you.

6
00:00:23,251 --> 00:00:27,671
(Sheldon:)As we are currently crushing you,
Wesley.

7
00:00:29,799 --> 00:00:33,139
(Wil:)It's customary for the player
on the right-hand lane to bowl first.

8
00:00:35,305 --> 00:00:36,845
(Penny:)All right.

9
00:00:45,023 --> 00:00:46,563
(Wil:)It's a custom, not a rule.

10
00:00:47,817 --> 00:00:49,947
(Sheldon:)I so loathe you.

11
00:00:50,987 --> 00:00:54,157
(Wil:)That's right, Sheldon.
Embrace the dark side.

12
00:00:56,785 --> 00:01:01,025
(Sheldon:)That's not even from your franchise.

